snp4.9:3.4 starts: Looking for what is ungrasped
snp4.9:3.5 starts: and detecting inner peace,
snp4.9:4.1 starts: Māgandiya:
snp4.9:4.3 starts: of not grasping
snp4.9:4.4 starts: This ‘inner peace’:
snp4.9:4.5 starts: How is it,
